Rock Readme
Readme at "kind" is "file"
Readme at "bytes" is 2

Rock Api
Api at "kind" is "file"
Api at "bytes" is 3

Rock Guide
Guide at "kind" is "file"
Guide at "bytes" is 5

Put Api at "bytes" into ApiSize
Put Guide at "bytes" into GuideSize
Put ApiSize plus GuideSize into DocsSize

Rock Docs
Docs at "kind" is "folder"
Docs at "left" is Api
Docs at "right" is Guide
Put DocsSize into Docs at "bytes"

Put Readme at "bytes" into ReadmeSize
Put ReadmeSize plus DocsSize into RootSize

Rock Root
Root at "kind" is "folder"
Root at "left" is Readme
Root at "right" is Docs
Put RootSize into Root at "bytes"

Print "leaf=" plus ReadmeSize
Print "docs=" plus DocsSize
Print "root=" plus RootSize
